a Fontenelle03/01/2025AssociateLiina Tulk03/01/2025Senior AssociateNilufar Shahpanahi03/01/2025Transactional LawyerHidde Kleijn01/01/2025Associate | Advocaat (qualified in the Netherlands)Abbi Hedges31/12/2024Associate (Solicitor Qualified in England &amp; Wales)Rieneke Reijnen31/12/2024Associate | Advocaat (qualified in the Netherlands)Tony Winterburn31/12/2024PartnerAna Carolina Salomão Queiroz21/12/2024Partner &amp; Chief Investment OfficerAbel Van Wijk26/11/2024Associate | Advocaat (qualified in the Netherlands)&nbsp;Please let me know if the report attached with the listed leavers can be sent to Helena.&nbsp;Thanks,C &nbsp;​​​​Chanelle&nbsp;Nichols(She/Her)HR&nbsp;Advisor+44&nbsp;(0)&nbsp;7483&nbsp;955&nbsp;070From: Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt; Sent: 01 October 2025 10:37To: Chanelle Nichols &lt;cnichols@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: Raminder Grewal &lt;rgrewal@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Dilan Alma &lt;dalma@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Subject: Practising certificate renewal 2025/2026 &nbsp;Hi Chanelle&nbsp;As discussed, here are the draft comms. You just need to update the internal declaration link for this year and we can get this out. &nbsp;Thanks H-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&nbsp;DRAFT COMMS &nbsp;Dear all,&nbsp;We are currently in the process of renewing your practising certificates. Pogust Goodhead can perform a bulk renewal of these practising certificates, but each individual solicitor must ‘opt in’ to the bulk renewal on the SRA website portal.&nbsp;Statement of competenceAs part of this exercise, each solicitor qualified in England and Wales, and any registered European Lawyers are expected to make a declaration to the SRA confirming that they have reflected on the quality of their practice and addressed any learning needs in the past year. For further information please see SRA Competence Statement which sets out core standards all solicitors should be able to undertake competently.&nbsp; &nbsp;How to provide your declaration &nbsp;Pogust Goodhead will be making a declaration to the SRA on your behalf as part of the bulk renewal. Once you have considered the competency statement, please complete the Internal Declaration. &nbsp;As part of the process, you may also upload evidence using the same link Internal Declaration and the attached template – whilst this step is not mandatory, you are encouraged to do so to help you maintain a record of your continuing professional development. &nbsp;Please complete this by Close of Business on Friday 17th October.&nbsp;Opting InMost people have already opted into the bulk renewal. If you have not done so, and you wish to be included in the process, please click the link below and select ‘opt in to bulk renewal’.&nbsp; Please ensure you opt in by the deadline of Friday 17th October.&nbsp;•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Using your “mySRA” account, SRA Log in•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Once you have logged in, please select “MyProfile” at the top of the screen•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Select “Work Details”, which will be along the top of the screen and the second from the left.&nbsp; Make sure your employment details at PGMBM Law Limited are added to your profile•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; After adding your employment details, you will see a table with the name of PGMBM Law Ltd, alongside other information. In the last column of the table, you will see the word “Manage”, which will open a new page•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Scroll down until you see: Practising certificate renewal [ ] I want to opt into the organisation’s bulk renewal&nbsp;Please note: if you choose not to opt in to the renewal, you will be responsible for renewing your own practising certificate.&nbsp;If you have any questions about this process or need any support, please do not hesitate to contact our @Compliance team.&nbsp;Kind regards,Helena YearwoodDirector of Risk and Compliance&nbsp; ​​​​Helena&nbsp;YearwoodRisk&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Compliance&nbsp;Director&nbsp;"}

