ip for the purposes of the Partnership Act 1890&nbsp;or Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2000. A list of partners is available on our website. For details about what personal information we collect and why, please see our Privacy Policy.From:&nbsp;Sophia Thomson &lt;SThomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;Sent:&nbsp;03 October 2025 11:58To: S.Teasdale@4newsquare.com&nbsp;&lt;S.Teasdale@4newsquare.com&gt;; Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Sarah Bingham &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc: spopplewell@leighday.co.uk&nbsp;&lt;spopplewell@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Jamie Macfarlane &lt;jmacfarlane@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; KLatham@kingschambers.com&nbsp;&lt;KLatham@kingschambers.com&gt;; T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&nbsp;&lt;T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&gt;; B.Williams@4newsquare.com&nbsp;&lt;B.Williams@4newsquare.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Defendants’ Submissions and Draft Order – Costs of CMH2&nbsp;CAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.&nbsp;Hi Simon,&nbsp;Sorry, it been a little bit mad this week. Confirming LD are reviewing now.&nbsp;Thanks,Sophia&nbsp;Sophia&nbsp;Thomson​​​​Costs Executive0161&nbsp;938&nbsp;0575​leighday.co.ukFollow&nbsp;us&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Panagram, 27 Goswell Road, London, EC1M 7AJ&nbsp;&nbsp;From:&nbsp;Simon Teasdale &lt;S.Teasdale@4newsquare.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;03 October 2025 11:38To:&nbsp;Sophia Thomson &lt;SThomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;; 'Anna Varga' &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; 'Sarah Bingham' &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; 'Michael Burke' &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Suzanna Popplewell &lt;SPopplewell@leighday.co.uk&gt;; 'Jamie Macfarlane' &lt;jmacfarlane@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; 'KLatham@kingschambers.com' &lt;KLatham@kingschambers.com&gt;; Theo Barclay &lt;T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&gt;; Benjamin Williams KC &lt;B.Williams@4newsquare.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;[EXTERNAL] RE: Defendants’ Submissions and Draft Order – Costs of CMH2&nbsp;&nbsp;Hi Sophia,&nbsp;Are there any comments on the draft Note? If not, I will finalise it this afternoon so it can be distributed.&nbsp;Thanks,Simon&nbsp;Simon&nbsp;Teasdale​​​​BarristerDirect&nbsp;+442078222119&nbsp;Mobile&nbsp;+447969074414&nbsp;Chambers&nbsp;+442078222000&nbsp;4&nbsp;New&nbsp;Square&nbsp;Chambers​Lincoln's&nbsp;Inn,&nbsp;London&nbsp;WC2A&nbsp;3RJFollow&nbsp;us&nbsp;on&nbsp;YouTube | LinkedIn​Discover&nbsp;our Events&nbsp;Privilege and Confidentiality Notice:This email is private as between the sender and the intended recipient. The information contained in this message and any file that may be attached to it are confidential between those parties and may be privileged. Any other party who receives it in error is not permitted to read, use, copy, discuss or pass on the information contained in either the message or its attachments, nor are they entitled to take any action in reliance on the contents. Therefore, if you are not the intended recipient you are kindly requested to contact me immediately by telephone on the numbers given above.Members of 4 New Square Chambers are regulated by the Bar Standards Board.NOTE TO SOLICITORS: ALL PAPERS RECEIVED FOR MEMBERS OF CHAMBERS WILL BE SENT FOR SECURE SHREDDING&nbsp;UPON COMPLETION OF WORK&nbsp;UNLESS YOU SPECIFICALLY REQUEST THEIR RETURN.From:&nbsp;Simon TeasdaleSent:&nbsp;01 October 2025 17:48To:&nbsp;Sophia Thomson &lt;SThomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Sarah Bingham &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Suzanna Popplewell &lt;spopplewell@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Jamie Macfarlane &lt;jmacfarlane@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; KLatham@kingschambers.com; Theo Barclay &lt;T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&gt;; Benjamin Williams KC &lt;B.Williams@4newsquare.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Defendants’ Submissions and Draft Order – Costs of CMH2&nbsp;Hi Sophia,&nbsp;Please see attached my proposed Note for firms flagging key points from the CMH2 judgment. It follows broadly the same structure as last year’s note following CMH1.&nbsp;I have not yet had a chance to discuss the final section (in relation to ATE cover) with Ben, and it’s a point on which there could be different views, so I would be grateful if this could be treated as a draft and not circulated more widely just yet. But I wanted to get it to you so that you could review and identify if there were any other queries about the judgment which you consider it would be helpful to address.&nbsp;Best wishes,Simon&nbsp;From:&nbsp;Simon Teasdale &lt;S.Teasdale@4newsquare.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;30 September 2025 17:42To:&nbsp;Sophia Thomson &lt;SThomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Sarah Bingham &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Suzanna Popplewell &lt;spopplewell@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Jamie Macfarlane &lt;jmacfarlane@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; KLatham@kingschambers.com; Theo Barclay &lt;T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&gt;; Benjamin Williams KC &lt;B.Williams@4newsquare.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;Re: Defendants’ Submissions and Draft Order – Costs of CMH2&nbsp;Hi Sophia&nbsp;Apologies for the delay. I’m just on my way back from a hearing in Liverpool today but will aim to get a draft out to you tomorrow for an initial review (to make sure it covers the points you need etc).&nbsp;Thanks for the heads up on the disbursements query. I’ll cover this as best I can from a budgeting perspective, though I suspect in practice this may be more a point for the contribution agreements etc that George is across.&nbsp;ThanksSimon&nbsp;Sent from Outlook for iOSFrom:&nbsp;Sophia Thomson &lt;SThomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;Sent:&nbsp;Tuesday, September 30, 2025 11:01:35 AMTo:&nbsp;Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Simon Teasdale &lt;S.Teasdale@4newsquare.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Sarah Bingham &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Suzanna Popplewell &lt;SPopplewell@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Jamie Macfarlane &lt;jmacfarlane@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; KLatham@kingschambers.com&nbsp;&lt;KLatham@kingschambers.com&gt;; Theo Barclay &lt;T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&gt;; Benjamin Williams KC &lt;B.Williams@4newsquare.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Defendants’ Submissions and Draft Order – Costs of CMH2&nbsp;EXTERNAL EMAILHi Simon,&nbsp;I hope you are doing well.&nbsp;Please could I follow up on the progress with the CMH2 Guidance note?&nbsp;There was one point in particular that was raised at one of the meetings with the CSC firms. It was queried whether the firms could have some guidance on how the approved pots work in terms of disbursements, and where they “sit”.&nbsp;Look forward to hearing from you.&nbsp;Best,Sophia&nbsp;Sophia&nbsp;Thomson​​​​Costs Executive0161&nbsp;938&nbsp;0575​leighday.co.ukFollow&nbsp;us&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Panagram, 27 Goswell Road, London, EC1M 7AJ&nbsp;&nbsp;From:&nbsp;Fiona Huddleston &lt;FHuddleston@leighday.co.uk&gt;Sent:&nbsp;26 September 2025 13:46To:&nbsp;Simon Teasdale &lt;S.Teasdale@4newsquare.com&gt;; Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Sarah Bingham &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Michael Burke &lt;mburke@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Suzanna Popplewell &lt;SPopplewell@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Sophia Thomson &lt;SThomson@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Jamie Macfarlane &lt;jmacfarlane@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; KLatham@kingschambers.com; Theo Barclay &lt;T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&gt;; Be