n error is not permitted to read, use, copy, discuss or pass on the information contained in either the message or its attachments, nor are they entitled to take any action in reliance on the contents. Therefore, if you are not the intended recipient you are kindly requested to contact me immediately by telephone on the numbers given above.Members of 4 New Square Chambers are regulated by the Bar Standards Board.NOTE TO SOLICITORS: ALL PAPERS RECEIVED FOR MEMBERS OF CHAMBERS WILL BE SENT FOR SECURE SHREDDING&nbsp;UPON COMPLETION OF WO"}

