 the only change will be paragraph 15, and it will be similar, if not the same, terms, but that we still need to check and redraft where necessary. The redrafting will be done by George over the weekend so we should be able to tell them we will have final versions for all GLOs early next week.&nbsp;Circulating this draft will be done in the hopes that getting something out – and also allowing for an opportunity to provide comments – will give us the breathing room needed to this final point checked over the weekend.&nbsp;It is our intention to circulate this draft tomorrow morning.&nbsp;Please could you let us know if you are happy with this so that we can do so?&nbsp;Separately, Zoe O’Sullivan KC and Jennifer Meech at Serle Court have not yet been sent the Pan NOx CFA and we will circulate that to them tomorrow morning too, however we are just noting for completeness that LD will be the only signatory to this.&nbsp;We look forward to hearing from you.&nbsp;Best,Sophia&nbsp;Sophia&nbsp;Thomson​​​​Costs Executive0161&nbsp;938&nbsp;0575​leighday.co.ukFollow&nbsp;us&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Panagram, 27 Goswell Road, London, EC1M 7AJ&nbsp;&nbsp;We are committed to protecting your privacy when you use our services and treat all personal data in accordance with our Privacy PolicyDisclaimerThe information contained in this communication from sthomson@leighday.co.uk&nbsp;sent at 2025-10-10 09:52:08 is confidential and may be legally privileged. It is intended solely for use by those authorised to receive it. If you are not so authorised, you are hereby notified that any disclosure, copying, distribution or taking action in reliance upon the contents of this information is strictly prohibited and may be unlawful. We do not accept service of documents by email.Please note that we only provide our bank account details in a password protected PDF. The password will be communicated separatel