why representations have been made to the Court, Defendants and staff that Gramercy do not have any role in the
 conduct, control or management of the NOx Group Litigations when plainly - they do and continue to do so;



whether the Board intends to update the Court as to the true position; and



whether the Board intends to inform the clients and other claimant firms of Gramercy's input into documents that
