gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Enquiry for Additional ATE Cover – Pan-NOx Emissions Litigation&nbsp;CAUTION: This email originated from outside of the organization. Do not click links or open attachments unless you recognize the sender and know the content is safe.&nbsp;Thanks for the update Tom. Look forward to receiving.&nbsp;Kind regards,&nbsp;James Burke&nbsp;Associate Director (Solicitor)Litigation and Contingent Risk FINEX Global&nbsp;WTWOn behalf of Willis Limited, 51 Lime Street, London, EC3M 7DQ (registered number 181116)On behalf of Willis Towers Watson SA/NV, Quai des Vennes, 4020, Liège, Belgium (registered as a branch in the UK at 51 Lime Street, London, EC3M 7DQ UK Branch Number BR021056) in relation to all EEA-regulated business&nbsp;D: +44 (0)20 31248037M: +44 (0)7831 162591&nbsp;james.burke2@wtwco.comwww.wtwco.com&nbsp;Financial, Professional, and Executive Risks (FINEX)Your Trusted Partner in Managing Complex Risk: Expertly navigating Litigation Risk, Cyber, Directors &amp; Officers, Financial Institutions, Mergers &amp; Acquisitions, Professional Indemnity, and Operational Risks within WTW.Part of our wider risk solutions capabilities at WTW&nbsp;At WTW we work flexibly - whilst you may receive emails from me out of working hours, I do not expect a response or action outside your own working hours.&nbsp;&nbsp;From:&nbsp;Tom Crow &lt;tcrow@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent:&nbsp;15 October 2025 18:43To:&nbsp;James Burke &lt;james.burke2@wtwco.com&gt;; Sarah Bingham &lt;sbingham@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Helena Yearwood &lt;hyearwood@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Cc:&nbsp;Jonathan Simon &lt;Jonathan.Simon@wtwco.com&gt;Subject:&nbsp;RE: Enquiry for Additional ATE Cover – Pan-NOx Emissions Litigation&nbsp;Hi James&nbsp;Just to confirm we are working on this&nbsp; and expect to provide the figures to you tomorrow&nbsp;RegardsTom&nbsp"}

