ce on the contents. Therefore, if you are not the intended recipient you are kindly requested to contact me immediately by telephone on the numbers given above.Members of 4 New Square Chambers are regulated by the Bar Standards Board.NOTE TO SOLICITORS: ALL PAPERS RECEIVED FOR MEMBERS OF CHAMBERS WILL BE SENT FOR SECURE SHREDDING&nbsp;UPON COMPLETION OF WORK&nbsp;UNLESS YOU SPECIFICALLY REQUEST THEIR RETURN.From: Jessica Fechner &lt;jfechner@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;Sent: Tuesday, September 30, 2025 7:42:27 PMTo: Anna Varga &lt;avarga@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Theo Barclay &lt;T.Barclay@4newsquare.com&gt;; Alicia Alinia &lt;aalinia@pogustgoodhead.com&gt;; Ben Jaffey KC &lt;benjaffey@blackstonechambers.com&gt;; OCampbellKC@hendersonchambers.co.uk &lt;OCampbellKC@hendersonchambers.co.uk&gt;; Benjamin Williams KC &lt;B.Williams@4newsquare.com&gt;Cc: Martyn Day &lt;mday@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Nichola Marshall &lt;nmarshall@leighday.co.uk&gt;; Sapna Malik &lt;smalik@leighday.co.uk&gt;Subject: RE: PG as Lead Sol - application + WS &nbsp;EXTERNAL EMAILTheo, all &nbsp;Please see attached an updated version of the statement in clean, which we now consider to be close to final. &nbsp;We have considered your below point and have made a minor amendment to para 37.1 as follows: &nbsp;The Firm has sufficient cash funding to pay all expected outgoings until the conclusion of the PDD Trial hearing in December. Most recent funding has been provided by Gramercy, through two facilities made available on 14 August 2025 (the “August Trance”) and 19 September 2025 (the “September Tranche”). The August Tranche amounted to $65 million; the September Tranche was $30 million. While the August Tranche can be used for Firm overhead but not on specific NOx Group Litigations fees, the September Tranche can, contractually, only be used for the NOx Group Litigations. The funds held are made available by Gramercy and the Firm draws down on cash to service its working capital requirements monthly against these facilities.&nbsp;Please do let us know if there are any final comments on the attached. &nbsp;Kind RegardsJess&nbsp;Jessica Fechner (she/her)Associate (England &amp; Wales qualified) Amsterdam &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;​​​​Jessica&nbsp;FechnerAssociateThis email and any attachments are confidential and may also be privileged. If you receive this message in error, please contact the sender immediately, destroy the email and any attachments and do not use, copy, store or disclose this email and any attachments for any purpose. Pogust Goodhead does not accept service of documents by electronic means without express prior agreement.&nbsp;Please note that our general terms and conditions apply to all our services. These general terms and conditions include a clause stipulating that our liability is excluded for damage caused by an event not covered by any insurance. The full general terms and conditions can be accessed via this link.​​Pogust Goodhead is the trading name of PGMBM Nederland B.V., a limited liability company registered at Chamber of Commerce (no. 83137718) with its registered office at Herengracht 433, 1017 BR Amsterdam. For details about what personal information we collect and why, please see our Privacy Policy.​​Deze e-mail en eventuele bijlagen zijn vertrouwelijk. Als u dit bericht ten onrechte ontvangt, neem dan onmiddellijk contact op met de afzender, vernietig de e-mail en eventuele bijlagen en gebruik, kopieer, bewaar of deel deze e-mail en eventuele bijlagen op geen enkele wijze. Pogust Goodhead aanvaardt geen betekening of kennisgeving van documenten langs elektronische weg zonder uitdrukkelijke voorafgaande toestemming.&nbsp;Op alle door Pogust Goodhead aanvaarde opdrachten zijn onze algemene voorwaarden van toepassing. De algemene voorwaarden bevatten onder meer een clausule waarin staat dat onze aansprakelijkheid is uitgesloten voor schade die niet door een verzekering wordt gedekt. De volledige tekst van onze algemene voorwaarden zijn toegan